          "row": 2,
          "col": 1,
          "html": "URL of ACS. Examples: \"<a href=\"https://example.com:8080/path/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://example.com:8080/path/</a>\", \"<a href=\"https://192.168.1.100/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://192.168.1.100/</a>\" <br/> If ACS is accessed using HTTPS, a Root CA must be imported on the client <a href=\"/docs/7.24/authentication-authorization-accounting/certificates\">certificate store</a> to verify the ACS server certificate."
        }
      ]
    },
